Q.1 Write a Java Program to implement Factory method for Pizza Store with createPizza(),
orederPizza(), prepare(), Bake(), cut(), box(). Use this to create variety of pizza’s
like NyStyleCheesePizza, ChicagoStyleCheesePizza etc.

a) Pizza.java
public abstract class Pizza {
 String name;
 String dough;
 String sauce;
 public void prepare() {
 System.out.println("Preparing " + name);
 }
public void bake() {
 System.out.println("Baking " + name);
 }
 public void cut() {
 System.out.println("Cutting " + name);
 }
 public void box() {
 System.out.println("Boxing " + name);
 }
 public String getName() {
 return name;
 }
}
b)PizzaStore.java
b)PizzaStore.java
public abstract class PizzaStore {
 public Pizza orderPizza() {
 Pizza pizza = createPizza();
 pizza.prepare();
 pizza.bake();
 pizza.cut();
 pizza.box();
 return pizza;
 }
 protected abstract Pizza createPizza(); // Factory Method
}
c)NYPizzaStore.java
public class NYPizzaStore extends PizzaStore {
 @Override
 protected Pizza createPizza() {
 return new NYStyleCheesePizza();
 }
}
d)ChicagoPizzaStore .java
public class ChicagoPizzaStore extends PizzaStore {
 @Override
 protected Pizza createPizza() {
 return new ChicagoStyleCheesePizza();
 }
}
